5. Manner of issuing invoice or bill or cash memo or receipt for goods sold
or services rendered.—(l) Every invoice, bill, cash memo or receipt for goods
sold or services rendered, issued by a seller shall have the following minimum
particulars, namely:—
(a) The name and address of the seller;
1. Ministry of Consumer Affairs, Food and Public Distribution (Deptt. of Consumer Affairs), Noti. No.
